# Claude Code credentials for the dev container.
#
# This is the template. Your real values go in claude.env.local next to it,
# which is created from this file on the first container start and is ignored
# by git (the repo's .gitignore ignores *.local).
#
# Fill in ONE of the two lines below by removing the leading "# ". No quotes,
# no spaces around "=". Then run "Dev Containers: Rebuild Container".

# Subscription token (Pro, Max, Team or Enterprise plan), valid for one year.
# Create it by running `claude setup-token` in the container's terminal.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# Or an API key from https://console.anthropic.com (billed per use).
# If both are set, the API key wins.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
